    sourceShape: "single-file" | "directory" | "manifest"
  }
  </?types>
  <fact-source ?01M02KBYJ0PA4MRDF6XV5GDJNG>
  事实源是资源作者拥有的 XNL 文档；registry 是只读派生投影，不反写 authority。
  </?01M02KBYJ0PA4MRDF6XV5GDJNG>
]>
